{
 "file": "07CSL01B base 0x5000",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:1c",
   "ptr": "0x1c",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「この老いぼれ学者の話が聞きたいか？\\n",
   "en": "\"You want to hear this old scholar talk, eh? ...Very well, I shall tell you. And I'll tell you even if you say no. I've time to kill, you see.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:45",
   "ptr": "0x45",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　・・・よかろう、話して進ぜよう。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:1c"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:6c",
   "ptr": "0x6c",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "　いやだと言っても聞かすぞ。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:1c"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:8d",
   "ptr": "0x8d",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "  わしゃ、ヒマだからな。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　いやだと言っても聞かすぞ。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:1c"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:ab",
   "ptr": "0xab",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　ユーバウム公爵を始めとするクライツ\\n",
   "en": "Duke Yubaum and the other nobles of Kreutzen, and most of its people too, all came to this land as settlers in the first place.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:d4",
   "ptr": "0xd4",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  ェンの貴族たちそして、住民のほとん\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:ab"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:fd",
   "ptr": "0xfd",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  どは、もともと、移民として、この地\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:ab"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:126",
   "ptr": "0x126",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "  にやって来たのじゃ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:ab"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:142",
   "ptr": "0x142",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　最初に上陸したのは聖堂騎士団と名乗\\n",
   "en": "The first to land were an armed band calling themselves the Templar Knights. With overwhelming might they drove out the natives and built a new country here.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:16b",
   "ptr": "0x16b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  る武装集団で、彼らは圧倒的な武力に\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:142"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:194",
   "ptr": "0x194",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  物を言わせ、原住民たちを駆逐し、こ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:142"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:1bd",
   "ptr": "0x1bd",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  の地に新たな国を建設したのじゃ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:142"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:1e5",
   "ptr": "0x1e5",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　それが、このクライツェンよ。\\f",
   "en": "And that country is Kreutzen.",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:209",
   "ptr": "0x209",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　その侵略戦争の際、古くから存在した\\n",
   "en": "In that war of conquest, nearly all the culture and history that had stood since ancient times was torn down and buried in darkness.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:232",
   "ptr": "0x232",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  文化や歴史は、ほとんどが打ち壊され、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:209"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:25d",
   "ptr": "0x25d",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "  闇に葬られてしもうた。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:209"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:27b",
   "ptr": "0x27b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　それから数百年の時が流れた今・・・\\f",
   "en": "And now, several hundred years later...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:2a5",
   "ptr": "0x2a5",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　長く続いた平和な時代。\\n",
   "en": "A long age of peace. A country that runs smoothly. Soldiers with time on their hands...",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:2c2",
   "ptr": "0x2c2",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "  順調な国の運営。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　長く続いた平和な時代。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:2a5"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:2d9",
   "ptr": "0x2d9",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  退屈を持てあます兵士たち・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  順調な国の運営。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:2a5"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:2ff",
   "ptr": "0x2ff",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  敵らしい敵は、たまに出没する三流\\n",
   "en": "The only enemies worth the name are third-rate monsters that turn up now and then.",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:326",
   "ptr": "0x326",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "  モンスターだけ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:2ff"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:33e",
   "ptr": "0x33e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　そんな状況こそが、人々の興味を古代\\n",
   "en": "And it's just that sort of situation that drew folk to the ancient ruins. After all, you can't guess what'll turn up until you dig, eh?",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:367",
   "ptr": "0x367",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  遺跡に引き寄せたのじゃ。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:33e"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:386",
   "ptr": "0x386",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  なにしろ、掘ってみなけりゃ、何が出\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  遺跡に引き寄せたのじゃ。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:33e"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:3af",
   "ptr": "0x3af",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  て来るか見当もつかんからのう。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:33e"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:3d5",
   "ptr": "0x3d5",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　ともすれば、ウワサの黒竜とやらが、\\n",
   "en": "Why, the Black Dragon of the rumors might really show itself... Either way, I can hardly wait, I tell you!\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:3fe",
   "ptr": "0x3fe",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  本当に出て来るかもしれぬ・・・\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:3d5"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:423",
   "ptr": "0x423",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　いずれにせよ、わしゃ、楽しみでなら\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:3d5"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:44c",
   "ptr": "0x44c",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "  んわい」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:3d5"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:45e",
   "ptr": "0x45e",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "「どうじゃ？\\n",
   "en": "\"Well? Hearing it from me beats going to some library, eh?\"",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:46f",
   "ptr": "0x46f",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　図書館などに行くより、わしに聞いた\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:45e"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:498",
   "ptr": "0x498",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "  方が、ためになるじゃろ？」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:45e"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:4bf",
   "ptr": "0x4bf",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "「遺跡の調査に関しては、賛否両論です。\\n",
   "en": "\"Opinion on the ruins survey is divided. Nobles and scholars are for it; fortune-tellers and the elderly are against it. Most soldiers seem to be just watching how things go.\"",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:4ea",
   "ptr": "0x4ea",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　貴族や学者は賛成、占い師や老人は反\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:4bf"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:513",
   "ptr": "0x513",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  対してます。  兵士たちの多くは、事\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:4bf"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:53c",
   "ptr": "0x53c",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "　態を静観してるようです」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:4bf"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:569",
   "ptr": "0x569",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "「リールから例の少女のことを？\\n",
   "en": "\"Riel told you about that girl? I see... You do have the same hair and eyes as it does...",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:58c",
   "ptr": "0x58c",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　なるほど、確かにあなたは、あれと同\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:569"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:5b5",
   "ptr": "0x5b5",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  じ髪と瞳を持ってますね・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:569"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:5d9",
   "ptr": "0x5d9",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　あれと会わせてみたら、何か新たな反\\n",
   "en": "Bringing you face to face with it might draw out some new reaction...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:602",
   "ptr": "0x602",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  応を引き出せるかもしれない・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:5d9"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:62a",
   "ptr": "0x62a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　わかりました。奥の部屋のカギは開け\\n",
   "en": "Very well. I'll leave the door to the back room unlocked. Go and meet it.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:653",
   "ptr": "0x653",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "  ておきます。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:62a"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:666",
   "ptr": "0x666",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  あれと対面してみてください。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  ておきます。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:62a"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:68a",
   "ptr": "0x68a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  ただし、不測の事態も考えられますか\\n",
   "en": "But something unforeseen could happen, so please be very careful.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:6b3",
   "ptr": "0x6b3",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  ら、充分に注意してくださいね」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:68a"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:6db",
   "ptr": "0x6db",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "「どうぞ、奥の部屋へ・・・」\\f",
   "en": "\"Please, go on into the back room...\"",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:702",
   "ptr": "0x702",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「あれが生きていると？・・・そうね、\\n",
   "en": "\"Is it alive, you ask? ...Well, I suppose in a sense you could say it's alive...\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:72b",
   "ptr": "0x72b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　確かに生きてると言えば生きてること\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:702"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:754",
   "ptr": "0x754",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  になるのでしょうけど・・・」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:702"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:77d",
   "ptr": "0x77d",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「ことわっておくが、あれはおそらく、\\n",
   "en": "\"I'll warn you now: that thing probably isn't human. ...You'll see once you meet it.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:7a6",
   "ptr": "0x7a6",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "  人間とは別の何かだよ。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:77d"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL01B:7c3",
   "ptr": "0x7c3",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　・・・あんたも、会えばわかるさ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  人間とは別の何かだよ。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL01B:77d"
  }
 ]
}
